  "facts": [
    "The Multi-Archer Tower is a multiple-targeting defense that unlocks at Town Hall 16, and is constructed by merging two level 21 Archer Towers together.",
    "Compared to two normal Archer Towers, the Multi-Archer Tower starts off with 50% more health and a bit more than double the total damage per second than the two combined, but attacks at a slower rate."
  ],
